`3 + γ' + (γ + e₁ + e₂ - 2) + e₃ < 5`, then
`∫∫ |A| |A'| s(g₁ - w)^(-e₁) s(w' - w)^(-e₂) s(h - w')^(-e₃) ≲ B² r^γ r'^γ'`
(`i2Psi2LintBound_diag_cross`).  It generalises `i2Psi2LintBound_chaos4_cross`.
